OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA rather cloudy start, with
OL,6,Fsome light rain and drizzle.
OL,7,FBrightening up for the afternoon, with
OL,8,Fa mixture of sunny spells and showers,
OL,9,Fagain these more likely in the north.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,12,Fcloudy on Monday, with rain expected
OL,13,Fovernight. This clearing to sunny
OL,14,Fspells and scattered showers for
OL,15,FTuesday and Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,16,Fnear average for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
